{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "22cfa2f3d51942b5cd910589b3cc7464110b7b49037241cff8a0464488c25278", "ja": "笑顔のために", "zh": "为了笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9824a53feb9bd8a72a29760a5af47b7774e0bfc10759cbb5f15c7e0fe1e18967", "ja": "番組もいよいよ終盤……と、ここまでピンチ\nヒッターを引き受けてきた瑞希に、疲れの色\nが見え始めた！　いち早く気付いた貴音は、\n瑞希を説得し休ませる。さあ、もうひと頑張\nり……感動のフィナーレをお見逃しなく！", "zh": "节目也终于接近尾声……一直以来承担替补工作的瑞希，开始显露出疲惫的神色！最先察觉到这一点的贵音说服瑞希，让她休息。好了，再加把劲……千万不要错过感动的结局！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4b2bf95de5b63e3473b4c5003ce3b1ac12af9bb8683651d0bceccd7f578a55c", "ja": "（番組も終盤に差し掛かってきた。\nエンディングまでのここが一番の頑張り時だな！）", "zh": "（节目也渐渐接近尾声了。到片尾之前，这可是最需要努力的时候啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1001_se", "source_sha256": "9d088307dc5ff134aa7abd87e11adf6b03149edfdabf2d93b84329e578b58687", "ja": "カンカンカンッ！", "zh": "锵锵锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "44a55bd51d156e3a30170f84cab326fec81d8a8fbec2ae712d4cdbb7276dcfa0", "ja": "そこまでっ！\n鐘が鳴りましたので、今のが最終問題となります。", "zh": "到此为止！\n钟声已经响起，刚才那道就是最后一题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "7fd5d7511c9c782b7c6277b67da1fa1760d8808675628e478bafc2f88927500d", "ja": "『間違えたら即終了！相方問答！』決勝に残ったのは、\n『TRICK&TREAT』と『Jus-2-Mint』だねぇ。", "zh": "晋级《答错就立即结束！搭档问答！》决赛的是《TRICK&TREAT》和《Jus-2-Mint》呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "d5b19564b42a9c6daf2e6834a25213071f4de3f1afdde6eda92ca04322ad3c12", "ja": "解答は茜さんと奈緒さんだよぉ。\nどちらが勝つのか……ドキドキするべさ！", "zh": "答案是茜姐和奈绪姐哦。\n不知道谁会赢……真让人心跳加速呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "767fe90b1e6dddfcf3cfffa928c73faa670d3a0da48f0070f5972ea8cb48f07e", "ja": "……あ、はい。これは名勝負の予感がします。\nでは答え合わせの前に、意気込みをどうぞ！", "zh": "……啊，是的。我有预感这会是一场精彩对决。\n那么，在公布答案之前，请先说说你的干劲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "d0c2ee9336ffe66623962bdc3290fe89cbba95d01f301027ec53477ab7a20877", "ja": "相手が茜やろうと誰やろうと、全力あるのみっ！\n茜、恨みっこなしやで？", "zh": "不管对手是茜还是谁，都只能全力以赴啦！\n茜，咱们可不记仇哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "4bd0b85692ce11cfd39e302f71bfc2bb8365c7e1db4dc62655fe5d1ec728a8b8", "ja": "今の言葉、まるごとお返しするね♪　ここまで残った\n茜ちゃんと麗花ちゃんの絆、とくと見よっ！", "zh": "你刚才那番话，原样奉还给你♪ 好好看看一路走到现在的小茜和丽花之间的羁绊吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "8203e6cbcda4813df91fcae478a5a8ab2c31c1d55c53d87fa5839a24636f7f46", "ja": "まずは『Jus-2-Mint』から参りましょう。質問は\n『横山奈緒の凄いところ』です。答えをどうぞ！", "zh": "首先从《Jus-2-Mint》开始吧。问题是“横山奈绪厉害的地方”。请作答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "399f0c46840f51e92e0e376b7b5b463e48b729b29ed0913845a9035135c98285", "ja": "美奈子が思ってる私のめっちゃすごいとこ！\nそれは……『トーク力』！　どやーっ！", "zh": "美奈子觉得我特别厉害的地方！那就是……“谈话能力”！怎么样——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1011_se", "source_sha256": "ddea13c17f29f7f756cea3f6406363860ef903eba6968fb0dcc247194437a204", "ja": "……ピンポンピンポーン！", "zh": "……回答正确！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "19a0da3f8d8000236c8bacbbbafbb8d5fa9cf4f2f7f64ef5165e98eabed5a51f", "ja": "よっしゃ！　これが私と美奈子の絆や！", "zh": "太好了！这就是我和美奈子的羁绊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "c07c22a0d61fb9ce2eebd0dbebc03b698191a9ef19767a57224c1a663b44aacb", "ja": "お見事です、横山奈緒。\nこれで勝負の行方はわからなくなりましたね。", "zh": "真是精彩，横山奈绪。\n这样一来，胜负的走向就难以预料了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "37f7b0fa19b9cf3de54d4219d3e99a2c0e947bdfdbf14a8977c534f8d7e79171", "ja": "はい。北上さんに出題した問題は『野々原さんの\n凄いところ』でした。それでは、お願いします！", "zh": "是的。给北上小姐出的题目是『野野原小姐厉害的地方』。那么，就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "050d73df238929dfea40f5ef0302c1851f7225f8f4db2cc5f217deed8d8437e0", "ja": "麗花ちゃんが思ってる茜ちゃんの凄いところ……\nずばり『なでなでしたい可愛らしさ』だよね♪", "zh": "丽花觉得小茜厉害的地方……说白了就是“可爱到让人想摸摸头”对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1016_se", "source_sha256": "f3e1afc7292bdd1c3c9a58a8fe246f2946ab2112bd361dada505eb697256ef24", "ja": "ブブー！　ブブブー！", "zh": "嘟嘟！嘟嘟嘟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "b9f77d17e7f9b76b89c04d378fbf6cc2c7a325986195d56f173d92270d7c7657", "ja": "うにゃ！？　なんでーーーっ！？\nてか音早くない？　奈緒やんみたいに焦らしてよ～！", "zh": "呜喵！？为什么啊——！？\n话说响得也太快了吧？应该像奈绪那样多吊吊胃口嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "68f6b11f86f0581690e57c1823742c45538fddd830a966063a0bed2bcb6bd773", "ja": "麗花さんの答えは『茜ちゃんの全部』だよぉ。\n茜さんは、ちょっこし惜しかったべさ。", "zh": "丽花小姐的答案是“小茜的全部”哦。茜小姐差一点点就答对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "eaa66e1395671b4fa6e15f2a1f974a3d179fe5550a6fcdeb2544688f46dfb39d", "ja": "は！　そんな風に思ってくれてたなんて……茜ちゃん、\n麗花ちゃんのこと誤解して……あれ？　麗花ちゃんは？", "zh": "啊！没想到你竟然是这么想的……小茜，我还误会了丽花……咦？丽花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "74225442804a682dda68e3e2f09ae3b0fc82621f4d4d512cbc17dbdf6f47705e", "ja": "次の準備をしに退席しましたよ、野々原茜？", "zh": "她去准备下一项了，野野原茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "087de57b698391cef8ff846309df74055d41b1da12ce843c3e5f9c73d6d8061f", "ja": "ええっ！？　なんて切り替えの早い……じゃなくて！\n置いてかないでよ、麗花ちゃーん！", "zh": "诶诶！？这转换也太快了吧……不对！\n别丢下我啊，丽花酱——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "1e6f5b403baf32ae93171293ee5b81c9f508805c960267c188acc3231366799e", "ja": "茜、この後のコメント！　って、行ってもうた。\nえーっと、これって、私らが優勝でええんかな？", "zh": "茜，接下来该你发表感言了！……她已经走掉了。\n呃——所以，算是咱们夺冠了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "34b8359a66aa8c04d18050d5360c6dede95ad339af73d28bffbd5f8c16aad44d", "ja": "はい。おめでとうございます、横山さん。\nそれでは優勝した感想を……。", "zh": "是的。恭喜您，横山小姐。\n那么，请谈谈获胜感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "0bbffee014072ea9c34ef758917e1bc1a6f62a49421e9b6efd09fa45088ba4af", "ja": "この後は『Xs』の『ときめきワード選手権』ですね。\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "接下来是『Xs』的“心动词语大赛”吧。\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6a5c5c111390b25fa4eb5ccbdbf7f75d9f5b74b7a40ca0187d7e99fb80f30639", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希。\n……大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "f393b17da36afdff488a47dc86b8631f8304cba35b28de330588818c9138a7d3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n私なら大丈夫です。ご心配ありがとうございます。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n我没事。谢谢您的关心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "59a679254a29ca611319186f8f26860b1c68906fbe802f3db6c7ab47c253a10c", "ja": "ここを乗り切れば、エンディングまですぐです。\nもう少し頑張ればいいだけですから……。", "zh": "熬过这一段，就很快到结尾了。\n只要再加把劲就行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fc2404ab1101cdb21df38d85626985ba9e327f986165e8bad03a33067f673ede", "ja": "……そうか。具合が悪いと思ったら、\nいつでもいいから声をかけてくれ。", "zh": "……这样啊。要是觉得身体不舒服，\n随时都可以跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "0a30a163f70efd8c160e116e5be0fc0b3072878b90e7e2592d71ed2929cd50c5", "ja": "？　はい、わかりました……。", "zh": "？好的，我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "646fd43e993cb6b8a13fadd67b629e3545bf145b851003144df2a0ccd484ad68", "ja": "あれ？　\n……ううっ。ちょっと困ったぞ。", "zh": "咦？\n……呜呜。这下有点伤脑筋了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "ab201fa4889afc2906673a211526f9e5aa1fb7632caaf56e5da5d16607d45686", "ja": "お疲れさまです、瑞希。\n少し時間をいただいても構いませんか？", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "78fd1a44e9a1929e1cfd7c4815fa130611576c3d4009c6300c4458ce55cc4463", "ja": "お疲れさまです、貴音さん。\nはい。時間ならありますが……何かありましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，贵音。\n有时间是有时间，不过……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1034_008tak", "source_sha256": "68a54fe52dee321c570bfbf1d7e003d539406ec1f509c5cc8f86ab26e3f5cd5e", "ja": "ええ。その……様々なこーなーで、\nぴんちひったーを引き受けていると聞いています。", "zh": "是的。那个……听说您在各种环节中都承担着救场替补的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1035_008tak", "source_sha256": "46aa1f38726217b2ff9629e7ff2a20bbc0314eaa936b980970d97d41c6feb170", "ja": "このような番組では、支え合う気持ちは大切です。\n瑞希のその心意気、心から感心いたします。", "zh": "在这样的节目中，互相扶持的心意很重要。瑞希的这份心意，令我由衷钦佩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "390e9bb28534a06c6e6afc06a326b4358b2077153a00f5c84ac7d7a52b25af38", "ja": "……ありがとう、ございます。\n貴音さんに褒められました。……うれしいな。", "zh": "……非常，感谢您。\n被贵音小姐夸奖了。……真开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "26741d914e3a2ad5c8b87a58fa156670acf5ebc60a58be2091bde9ed8f747471", "ja": "でも私ができることを、精一杯しただけです。\nいま動かなかったら、きっと後悔すると思ったので。", "zh": "但我只是竭尽全力做了自己能做的事。\n因为我觉得，如果现在不行动的话，一定会后悔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1038_008tak", "source_sha256": "b4f10ff1de7384836981b27be631f7a1e9f67de9427d01c25f6b9ec44e5a2160", "ja": "なるほど。良い心がけですね。\nですが、いささか無理をしているのではありませんか？", "zh": "原来如此。态度很好。\n不过，你是不是有些太勉强自己了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1039_008tak", "source_sha256": "f2a9c06fabeeedd7a43b6e772f5686d03c170b80402ea527d05cb085abe5c412", "ja": "例えば、先程のくいずこーなー。\n瑞希の言葉が、一瞬出遅れたと思いましたが……。", "zh": "比如刚才的猜谜环节。\n我觉得瑞希的话好像有一瞬间慢了一拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "30379a57862ce089da8756c4bd506bebbaf4dc6dc5e86ac2c0f38931d8a636ef", "ja": "たまたまです。私も頑張らないと……。\n{$P$}だって頑張ってますから。", "zh": "只是碰巧而已。我也得努力才行……\n毕竟{$P$}也在努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1041_008tak", "source_sha256": "c7bc22babeb6b34749151e3da649b00404511f5dbabf90ed0ccde7f93c25c523", "ja": "瑞希……。\nあなたは、この番組のこんせぷとを覚えていますか？", "zh": "瑞希……\n你还记得这个节目的概念吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "d5e1081f1f4841c1306dcf2a43452b5b1a8182006d9f5d51afa56ee81788ea07", "ja": "はい。『みんなを元気に！笑顔をあなたに！』ですが、\nそれが何か……？", "zh": "没错。是“让大家打起精神！把笑容带给你！”，\n有什么问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1043_008tak", "source_sha256": "f1067c8faa2599467cb7438f27e4829ed5b31258d9788d0deea26f67135df8f8", "ja": "では問います、真壁瑞希。\nあなたの笑顔は、皆を元気にできますか？", "zh": "那么我问你，真壁瑞希。\n你的笑容能让大家打起精神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "884eadda4908806477f15ef12eb45520793546d90f040168da106c4f48879e76", "ja": "……えっ。\nそれは……私はやはり、無表情ということ……。", "zh": "……诶。\n那意思是……我果然还是，面无表情吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "5528a55d97adfd5352a04eb8fdb20703294214e99aa2d2158ea895bde8aeba42", "ja": "貴方の心が表情豊かな事は、もう皆も知っていますよ。\nですが今、その心は……本当に笑顔になっていますか？", "zh": "大家都已经知道，您的内心感情丰富。不过现在，您的内心……真的在微笑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1046_008tak", "source_sha256": "09344ca8d07942ae9c3357488a48a9eafc3ffbb55ff081e6a58aa19b1ae36135", "ja": "貴方は隠しているのかもしれませんが、\nそばにいる私達は気づいていますよ。", "zh": "您或许是在隐瞒，但我们这些在您身边的人都察觉到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1047_008tak", "source_sha256": "140ced3b837134e8d0bb332f415911aace872453e1558d3423a41697c07ad17a", "ja": "当然、{$P$}も気づいています。\nおそらく、瑞希を一番見ているファンの方々も……。", "zh": "{$P$}自然也注意到了。\n恐怕，注视瑞希最久的粉丝们也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1049_008tak", "source_sha256": "384ea0786f13d1bb55d08aa3f19e91aeab2eb96a80dbdd856b945235b9618823", "ja": "ファンが見たいのは、疲れを隠した笑顔ではなく、\n心から楽しんでいる瑞希の笑顔ではないですか？", "zh": "粉丝们想看到的，不是隐藏疲惫的笑容，而是真心享受其中的瑞希的笑容，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "5d82a9267f532d03269b65137a0a6befa5fabd0ba1d5119c78b6f3b43eec6071", "ja": "それに……私も心から思っています。\n番組の最後は、全員の、輝くような笑顔で迎えたいと。", "zh": "而且……我也是真心这么想的。希望在节目最后，以大家灿烂的笑容迎接结尾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "dda0f10b8d2291e96c7ab2d31860a9f28b45717853c800fdc482fa90d502718a", "ja": "貴音さん……。", "zh": "贵音姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1052_044miz", "source_sha256": "a688f2c2a7c057af93b1a200e9965ed16727dcdf8cbbb2a4a6893a02089df7e2", "ja": "私も、同じ気持ちです。\nみんなでエンディングを迎えたい。心からの笑顔で。", "zh": "我也有同样的心情。\n想和大家一起迎来结尾，发自内心地笑着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1053_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba1774cf1abc256f940a11f61ac2db1b7c86f829c4467a96985ee0a42131646d", "ja": "……貴音さん。わかりました。\nではひとつ、お願いをしてもよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "……贵音小姐。我明白了。\n那么，我可以向您提一个请求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "44828bdaf0eb8b84df58112123e9d1bd167633e03f3df226abd060d2c69e2c21", "ja": "貴音。瑞希の様子は？", "zh": "贵音，瑞希的情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1055_008tak", "source_sha256": "8112e956713c4082270501d38174caf72bd89186b1e81f78ecab698a52209446", "ja": "相当疲れていたのでしょう。\n横になった途端、すぐに寝入ってしまいました。", "zh": "她应该是相当疲惫了吧。\n一躺下就立刻睡着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1056_008tak", "source_sha256": "90487981e44ae6a23a815740323f7733a4d9488d70ee2a1f383947f6cb70b17d", "ja": "{$P$}、\n瑞希の出番についてですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n关于瑞希的出场安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "9da12a3370a1d59e278b3078ce93df7859156da69a6c14f8edf5e8793ee9241e", "ja": "わかってる。奈緒達も呼んで調整しよう！\nそれにしても、貴音に説得を頼んでよかったよ。", "zh": "我知道。把奈绪她们也叫来协调一下吧！\n话说回来，拜托贵音去说服真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1058_008tak", "source_sha256": "05096de0bff529e48d2037b0b7c28ffdd87d0431ed4d322c7a6e56f466306fa3", "ja": "そうですね。{$P$}のように\n頑張ろうとしていたようでしたから。", "zh": "是啊。因为她似乎也想像{$P$}一样努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1059_008tak", "source_sha256": "895c6319bd54b8861f892436de37eaa4914e384c8b07f0200829ea5f9d1aa5f0", "ja": "あなた様の言葉が届かなかったのも仕方ないかと。\n真、頼もしい後輩です。私も負けていられませんね。", "zh": "您的话没能传达给她，也是没办法的事。真是个可靠的后辈。我也不能输给她呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0185_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "d4e46f7f2f75fdd23de26739a8d279f10918318953f3fadc21e2eef68ce64c79", "ja": "はは、そうだな。って、話してる場合じゃないな。\nすぐに出番の調整をしよう！", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过现在可不是聊天的时候。马上调整出场顺序吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
